#### 2.9.3 Mocking Philosophy (No Mock or Limited Mock | Beyond Happy Path | No Fake Green)

**CRITICAL RULES:**

- **No Mocks for Money Logic**: Real database (Testcontainers), real storage, real dependencies
- **Beyond Happy Path**: Test errors, edge cases, abuse scenarios
- **No Fake Green**: Tests must fail when code is broken (verify this)

**Allowed Mocking:**
- External services (payment processors, third-party APIs)
- Time (controlled clocks)
- Randomness (deterministic generators)

**Forbidden Mocking:**
- Storage (use Testcontainers or real test storage)
- Business logic functions
- Economic calculations
- Authorization logic

**AI Checklist:**
- [ ] No mocks for money-critical code
- [ ] Real database/storage in tests
- [ ] Error paths tested, not just success
- [ ] Tests verified to fail when code is broken

